From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:28:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 497/497] spark-ds41f names: the indexer's split check is
 SPARK_DS41F_INDEXER_SPLIT_CHECK

The SPARK3_* to SPARK_DS41F_* rename kept this variable's model infix, so
it read SPARK_DS41F_DS41_INDEXER_SPLIT_CHECK: the project name already says
DS4.1. It is a validation switch (off unless set): under a sequence-parallel
indexer split every rank also runs the full-row indexer and compares its rows.
No recipe sets it, and nothing else reads the old name.

Tests: none read the variable; serving is unchanged with it unset.
---
 vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/attention.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/attention.py b/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/attention.py
index ac6f73a92..b9512167d 100644
--- a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/attention.py
+++ b/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/attention.py
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@ logger = init_logger(__name__)
 
 # Validation only: under a sequence-parallel indexer split, every rank also runs
 # the full-row indexer twice and compares its own rows with the split result.
-_INDEX_SPLIT_CHECK = os.environ.get("SPARK_DS41F_DS41_INDEXER_SPLIT_CHECK") == "1"
+_INDEX_SPLIT_CHECK = os.environ.get("SPARK_DS41F_INDEXER_SPLIT_CHECK") == "1"
 
 
 def _source(prefix, layer):
